msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫…………."

#: prologue:prologue_9C5985A3_A450_4279_89AD_E4C9055CB369
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0b14da540b0370191bde648ed650c0ce643b76d42b6b01ae6d1f531e4ab66737
#. default-sha256: a2e3c0e3c44f3ee199e6a2d421d12a3ac0f5583a11a015efb1c1e4a717d58b75
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_9C5985A3_A450_4279_89AD_E4C9055CB369"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What’s the occasion? You never come to wake me up."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫당신이 저를 깨우다니 ⟪k:1⟫별일도 다 있군요."

#: prologue:prologue_68962FD1_5789_4814_BF46_B3586D07440A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5fc93c345b2224abecf9f203610c6a1b63b16840b20e1b25f3c58be88f716e36
#. default-sha256: da83cfd80e76994fd00524a50d2cf9cdd8c016bec23a12f18359e4a3dd613393
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_68962FD1_5789_4814_BF46_B3586D07440A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I was merely concerned for your health.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You really should be sleeping in a "
"proper bed."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그런 데서 주무시길래, ⟪k:2⟫감기라도 걸리시면 큰일이겠다 싶어서요."

#: prologue:prologue_CF9E89B3_32AE_40C3_9AFC_47CEAC6DA8C3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c56bb9088dbd870d2830e2037be85d8816c16fb581d308934d2e7bca8d7da793
#. default-sha256: d32601cf7d040a1791d74900296a66f69449351c0a3434bbb813bc2b7be56b0f
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_CF9E89B3_32AE_40C3_9AFC_47CEAC6DA8C3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You were ⟪k:3⟫concerned⟪k:4⟫? About ⟪k:5⟫me⟪k:6⟫?⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫You do realize the "
"concept of “health” bears little meaning for either of us, don’t you?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫감기는 안 걸려요, ⟪k:3⟫이미 그런 육체가 아니잖아요.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫……그런데 ⟪k:6⟫제 걱정"
"이요?"

#: prologue:prologue_42F500E6_AADF_4523_B5D0_46846E73867B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 54441e032858539976c03d30324ef5854b1ae8aaa9c2545897b2312630f6ed61
#. default-sha256: a7da146bc6f2aca8282bc613b5462ad292ff22b6a5a32bf1eba4ef57574e35f3
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_42F500E6_AADF_4523_B5D0_46846E73867B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Why would I not be concerned? ⟪k:2⟫You ⟪k:3⟫are⟪k:4⟫ me.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫If something were to "
"cause you to depart this world,⟪k:7⟫the same would happen to me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫네, ⟪k:2⟫당신은 ⟪k:3⟫바로 저 아닌지요?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫당신이 사라지면 ⟪k:6⟫저도 사라지니까요."

#: prologue:prologue_B351EC4B_885F_482C_B4CB_BCEFFF7E34F7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0b12e310a6619d55ce2612a97906f4c1f1121be71a38eec4e2396fc2ed57128c
#. default-sha256: e5ddf7395e0bc5316937180bc3473c6279a2e19570fa5dccd333c024892d32d2
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_B351EC4B_885F_482C_B4CB_BCEFFF7E34F7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ahh... ⟪k:3⟫right.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫That’s true."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫아아……, ⟪k:3⟫그렇죠. ⟪k:4⟫그렇긴 해요."

#: prologue:prologue_219F44A4_AECD_4C4F_AFBA_6559324490AB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f781f59978969af6da1e1f15800ec46584eae5f1dd81f4ffe7083e75dfc7e8b6
#. default-sha256: a1db446f71b049f99d27fcc170f79266784075ae13d56f0d58852b85248aef1d
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_219F44A4_AECD_4C4F_AFBA_6559324490AB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(It was so long ago, I almost forgot I told her she was me.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫And it would seem she "
"still believes that to be the case.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(그러고 보니 오래 전에 ⟪k:1⟫그런 소릴 했지.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ 그걸 완전히 믿긴……)"

#: prologue:prologue_3BF7FF21_91E5_45AA_8A70_93A97AE211F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a04a048437eb8b1391089e5471a7032bb774eb5f2610c4c604d59c20d777662
#. default-sha256: 4b913962ae29b563ddaeb4f980f5e64c01487495ccc0ef900ab1df0204e937ce
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_3BF7FF21_91E5_45AA_8A70_93A97AE211F1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(Foolish woman.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(어리석은 사람인걸……)"

#: prologue:prologue_2494829B_6EF8_4259_8A89_724BF8C2E9BE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 142e74c0587be5dbdadc20d104f45bdf7fb8b228ef3969a3788bce05bdc70427
#. default-sha256: d5ff711fa57739db319b33cfa329ad93bfa9d15243608d599c33bcedb58319bc
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_2494829B_6EF8_4259_8A89_724BF8C2E9BE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hehe... ⟪k:2⟫What kind of herbal tea would you like to start your day with?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I "
"have some lovely mint leaves, if you would like.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫They are wonderful for improving one’s "
"mood."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫후후……, ⟪k:2⟫각성용 허브티는 어떤 걸로 하시겠는지요?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫속이 편해지도록 ⟪k:5⟫민트"
"로 할까요."

#: prologue:prologue_A3379ACC_2922_40DF_B93A_42D0249E6756
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ca188bdca9cbabf4f66d570d9897ac6f563516cc5c0f6c57f5281e2b74861838
#. default-sha256: 13da7e60df59dbf394f7119c03bc09b628ab48b1baee572a8a37c2488babebfd
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_A3379ACC_2922_40DF_B93A_42D0249E6756"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I have no interest in—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫or need for—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫tea."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫차도 안 마셔요, ⟪k:3⟫저에게는 불필요해요."

#: prologue:prologue_2A7416EA_6EC3_4EC3_B482_0837EB84EE2E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 71053085a1a875dcb65ab9c9d8c07b9f1891fe73fab948c4db605ab977b784ec
#. default-sha256: c19598031be541d8b724b33f0fba9dc3ac0be913cb75a75f055a5da32f597d03
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_2A7416EA_6EC3_4EC3_B482_0837EB84EE2E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That is most unfortunate."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫어머……, ⟪k:2⟫아쉬워라."

#: prologue:prologue_8FC837AF_E40A_4C1D_94F4_77A8DB4EDBD0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b2c31c7de0297d37c989a9411ab38b3e05e49d0a3c23e954dfc58a72a26fde7f
#. default-sha256: 6ffc7d2b4e1d6f4741666f02e5bc0f79b1a4e5808bb8d2c4e75d1e56257778b5
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_8FC837AF_E40A_4C1D_94F4_77A8DB4EDBD0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫In that case, perhaps you could tell me a story?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……그렇다면 ⟪k:2⟫기왕 이러는 거 ⟪k:3⟫이야기를 들려 주시겠는지요?"

#: prologue:prologue_403866E0_6E4F_493B_A27C_2C7EAFE6329E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ae942c6a91bf5c460d1dd09126557c6425c2df67d7075c25c9470b3bf603f5e7
#. default-sha256: ad1134a6f9535d9fe1bde2c9ce638043623e144c40961ea9ee065e290098934e
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_403866E0_6E4F_493B_A27C_2C7EAFE6329E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫A story?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You mean the one about Michel and Giselle again?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫이야기라뇨. ⟪k:3⟫또 ⟪k:4⟫지젤과 미셸 이야기인가요?"

#: prologue:prologue_0B05D229_DD6F_426C_BBE6_F3909259CA5D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d41f1e2a2fe5f792e699185cf84cabb79ac451f717d838249bc12f32d2fefe5d
#. default-sha256: 6f2431f7eddfc32d88366824577ea6bd112ab37bd87c36d371e0ff196693885f
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_0B05D229_DD6F_426C_BBE6_F3909259CA5D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Yes, that one.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I do love that story oh so very much."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫네, ⟪k:2⟫맞아요. ⟪k:3⟫저는 ⟪k:4⟫그 이야기가 가장 좋답니다."

#: prologue:prologue_4604B25A_659B_44D1_9FFC_0469BC280F95
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a499608bfc680262c7b95bac02fbbfe91369ac44274e8f7b1387c558c3eb291
#. default-sha256: cfbbb0e384f2ac68655709650821993dcc881578522b93b5388a15070262953f
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_4604B25A_659B_44D1_9FFC_0469BC280F95"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I, for one, am growing rather tired of it.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I’ve told it to you dozens of "
"times now."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫이미 지겹게 이야기했잖아요, ⟪k:3⟫제가 질렸어요."

#: prologue:prologue_DB2E9551_BD10_4F5E_B19B_02E32600B333
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b1f770a5aa5d302499054692737351d4156fceb7a377507aa76570eaa09147df
#. default-sha256: 70029f60b63dd9adc5c132959ad0549fc5329375fd15bfbfe756648b69fbe0f7
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_DB2E9551_BD10_4F5E_B19B_02E32600B333"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Now, don’t be like that.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫The best stories never stop being moving,⟪k:4⟫no "
"matter how many times you hear them."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫해 주지 그러시어요, ⟪k:2⟫아름다운 이야기는 몇 번을 들어도 가슴이 뛰는걸요."

#: prologue:prologue_FE9551A9_E7B3_4525_AC83_90F29E5824B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2d51b178aa643b819bbfdd9fcd60f60fa7dc27e031490628f2134e444ed0ff27
#. default-sha256: 752a3f29c014efecc790bd8ff3bdbfd05cdc688adcd92016bf1511174c45e37b
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_FE9551A9_E7B3_4525_AC83_90F29E5824B3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫(It’s like I’m talking to a child...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫(좀 귀찮은데……)"

#: prologue:prologue_9A642A70_8B15_47C9_BD7B_BEB6E479AED8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6edac237759355356016a7f69a17de95a11630489550fefa2800da9f68827ca2
#. default-sha256: ef4339be0b9629ecd52a79188f38d8c1be75f245f7276e976f3a08c9b8a09fdb
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_9A642A70_8B15_47C9_BD7B_BEB6E479AED8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫All right, then, how about this? ⟪k:1⟫I’m going to ask you a question,⟪k:2⟫and if you give "
"me an answer I like, I’ll tell you the story again."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……그렇죠, ⟪k:1⟫그럼 ⟪k:2⟫제가 마음에 드는 대답을 하시면 ⟪k:3⟫또 이야기해 드릴게요."

#: prologue:prologue_37041A75_7016_4F96_B9C5_AD3F59AEC5F5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f742b2def2b704521d6d8063a9f5cf05191f62d186789ed811f551fd3a97df46
#. default-sha256: d8e5ebb379894f25ee858ae0284537e3e35ea76d510c0f5e311c2af1ff678fc3
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_37041A75_7016_4F96_B9C5_AD3F59AEC5F5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh? What kind of question?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫어머나, ⟪k:2⟫어떤 대답을 하면 될지요."

#: prologue:prologue_DDEDFAD1_E397_4B12_B05A_473A3CDE182C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 46d2885a65ec50af646947301d425d9faf972e8300a353fa5cc6f16dc05c2bc9
#. default-sha256: ac2fb6d80b80906781fcee33ecfc6edf48d92cb3ca1cb76a19ff7fdc7b967d5c
msgctxt "prologue:prologue_DDEDFAD1_E397_4B12_B05A_473A3CDE182C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hehe... ⟪k:3⟫Nothing difficult, I promise.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I want to hear your opinion on "
"something."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫후후……, ⟪k:3⟫간단한 질문이에요.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫당신의 의견을 물으려는 거죠."

